    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 0 Orchestrator\n**Vancouver sources** lists the datasets to watch. **1 Collect** runs once per source, **2 Score** picks the week's strongest change, then Write, Voice, Render and Publish.\n\nIf any step says `ok: false`, or errors, **No story today** tells the editor why in Slack.\n\n**Every morning** stays off while building.\n\nTo test the guard, set `test_tamper` to true in **Run options**.",
